6-L36","doc":"`α³ = -I`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Su2Generators.z_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Su2Generators.z_sq","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Su2Generators.lean#L34-L34","doc":"`(-I)² = I`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Su2Generators.z_central","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Su2Generators.z_central","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Su2Generators.lean#L32-L32","doc":"`z` is central. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Su2Generators.z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Su2Generators.z","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Su2Generators.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The central element `-I`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Su2Generators.β","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Su2Generators.β","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Su2Generators.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Lift of a transposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Su2Generators.α","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Su2Generators.α","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Su2Generators.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Lift of the 3-cycle. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Su2Generators.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Su2Generators.mk","kind":"ctor","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Su2Generators.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Su2Generators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Su2Generators","kind":"structure","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Su2Generators.lean#L19-L40","doc":"The binary dihedral group `Dic₃` presented inside an ambient group `G`.\n\nA `definition` carrier: generators `α, β`, the central element `z = -I`,\nand the defining relations `α³ = z`, `β² = z`, `z² = 1`, `z` central, and\nthe dihedral relation `βαβ⁻¹ = α⁻¹`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:su2-generators","label":"def:su2-generators","md":"quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/su2-generators.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}